{"3254020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exit Zone", "steam_appid": 3254020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains visual and audio anomalies, disorienting effects, and psychological horror.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a decaying zone where time loops and reality fractures. The lights flicker. The corridors repeat. Something is deeply wrong—and it's getting worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Zone</strong> is a memory-based anomaly horror game inspired by Exit 8, designed for <strong>1–5 players</strong>. Every corridor looks the same—until it doesn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings. Memorize every room, object, sound, and corridor. Advance only when you're certain everything is normal—then pull the <strong>green lever</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything feels off, hit the <strong>red lever</strong> before it’s too late. Anomalies can be subtle… or dangerous.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and the zone resets—or worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/129e91bcf142775ce2f5568df34480af.avif?t=1787849045\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Observation Mechanics</strong>  <br>Spot shifting elements in the environment: misplaced objects, altered text, warped visuals, impossible physics, or entities that shouldn’t exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Multiplayer (1–5 Players)</strong>  <br>Work together to share memory and identify anomalies—or split up and risk it alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong>  <br>Each playthrough generates new anomaly patterns, ensuring replayability and paranoia every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat – Just Observation</strong>  <br>The only way out is to observe, remember, and choose the correct path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/c481272508224c4b560da1a55bf94098.avif?t=1787849045\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Exit Zone Different?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True psychological tension – no cheap jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted world designed to sharpen your perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies escalate the longer you remain inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you remember where the door was? Are you sure that corpse wasn’t here before?</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and you’ll be part of the zone forever.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Exit Zone.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains visual and audio anomalies, disorienting effects, and psychological horror.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a decaying zone where time loops and reality fractures. The lights flicker. The corridors repeat. Something is deeply wrong—and it's getting worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Zone</strong> is a memory-based anomaly horror game inspired by Exit 8, designed for <strong>1–5 players</strong>. Every corridor looks the same—until it doesn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings. Memorize every room, object, sound, and corridor. Advance only when you're certain everything is normal—then pull the <strong>green lever</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything feels off, hit the <strong>red lever</strong> before it’s too late. Anomalies can be subtle… or dangerous.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and the zone resets—or worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/129e91bcf142775ce2f5568df34480af.avif?t=1787849045\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Observation Mechanics</strong>  <br>Spot shifting elements in the environment: misplaced objects, altered text, warped visuals, impossible physics, or entities that shouldn’t exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Multiplayer (1–5 Players)</strong>  <br>Work together to share memory and identify anomalies—or split up and risk it alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong>  <br>Each playthrough generates new anomaly patterns, ensuring replayability and paranoia every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat – Just Observation</strong>  <br>The only way out is to observe, remember, and choose the correct path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/c481272508224c4b560da1a55bf94098.avif?t=1787849045\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Exit Zone Different?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True psychological tension – no cheap jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted world designed to sharpen your perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies escalate the longer you remain inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you remember where the door was? Are you sure that corpse wasn’t here before?</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and you’ll be part of the zone forever.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Exit Zone.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Exit Zone is a multiplayer horror game with anomalies for 1–5 players, memorize every corridor, uncover anomalies, and make the right decisions—before Exit Zone traps you forever.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/c6d692e456406f667d2e96c18c440289125976b5/header.jpg?t=1787849045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/58e0accf7ae6c0e1af10937fb3d0e26b1c7a082a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787849045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/58e0accf7ae6c0e1af10937fb3d0e26b1c7a082a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787849045", "website": "https://galacticgames.site/exit-zone", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950/Radeon R7 370 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game should work even on worse co